Description:
    Retrofits spreadsheet bulk-import support onto a model that already
    exists (built via the scaffold generator, or by hand) - never creates a
    model itself.

    Pass the model name (CamelCased, module-prefixed if namespaced). The
    model's policy must already inherit DisciplineResourcePolicy, or
    TagablePolicy if using --tagable.

    --tagable: target is a tagable model. Skips controller and route
    injection entirely, since every tagable type already shares one
    controller and one generic set of routes - only the importer service,
    view, fixture, and tests are generated.

    Without --tagable, injects the Importable concern and import/
    create_import routes into the model's own existing controller/routes.
    --discipline-association and --nesting fine-tune that injection - see
    docs/GENERATORS.md for details.

    Run with --pretend first to preview every file/edit without touching
    anything.

Examples:
    `bin/rails generate project_assistant:import Document`
    `bin/rails generate project_assistant:import Electrical::Motor --tagable`
